		<dataLineage>
			<prcStep>
				<stepDesc>The Rail Yards dataset was created using the North American Rail Network (NARN) Lines. The NARN Lines were filtered using the ArcGIS Pro Select Layer By Attribute tool to select records that were populated with a YARDNAME (SQL Expression: "NET" IS 'Yard Tracks' OR "YARDNAME" IS NOT NULL). The filtered selection was then dissolved by "RROWNER1", "YARDNAME", and "STCNTYFIPS” using the ArcGIS Pro Dissolve tool to create a multipart output with dissolved lines. The result is a dataset that represents one Rail Yard per record that is unique by "RROWNER1", "YARDNAME", and "STCNTYFIPS”.</stepDesc>
			</prcStep>
		</dataLineage>
	</dqInfo>
